{"_id":"68a736218ec3d8323af1908d","nodeId":"X2rJ3BY1ytFKsbJqJETFu","roadmapSlug":"java","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:13.404Z","description":"# Ebean\n\nEbean is an object-relational mapping tool written in Java. It supports the standard JPA annotations for declaring entities. However, it provides a much simpler API for persisting. In fact, one of the points worth mentioning about the Ebean architecture is that it is sessionless, meaning it does not fully manage entities.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Ebean","url":"https://ebean.io/","_id":"692485f1467651eddb4d3377"},{"type":"official","title":"Ebean Documentation","url":"https://ebean.io/docs/","_id":"692485f1467651eddb4d3378"},{"type":"article","title":"Guide to Ebean","url":"https://www.baeldung.com/ebean-orm","_id":"692485f1467651eddb4d3379"}],"updatedAt":"2025-11-24T16:21:05.627Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04defb5fcb94d0416bad","title":"DataCamp - Java Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/GbYnP9"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/java/content/X2rJ3BY1ytFKsbJqJETFu.md"}